<title>THAILAND: TelecomAsia's unit to issue new shares.</title>
<headline>TelecomAsia's unit to issue new shares.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>TelecomAsia Corp Plc said on Friday that its subsidiary Telecom Holding will issue two million common shares at 10 baht par.</p>
<p>The company said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand that Telecom Holding would ask TelecomAsia to pay one billion baht, or half of the planned capital increase first.</p>
<p>It said the issuance of new common shares would raise Telecom Holding's registered capital to 11 billion baht.</p>
<p>The proceeds will be used as working capital, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
